<span class="font-data-mono text-body-sm text-white font-semibold">1,500 SQ. FT.</span>
</div>
<div class="py-space-sm flex justify-between items-center">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300">Standard Tolerances</span>
<span class="font-data-mono text-body-sm text-electric-cyan font-bold">± 0.005 mm</span>
</div>
<div class="py-space-sm flex justify-between items-center">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300">High-Speed Spindles</span>
<span class="font-data-mono text-body-sm text-white font-semibold">Makino VMC Series</span>
</div>
<div class="py-space-sm flex justify-between items-center">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300">CAD/CAM Integration</span>
<span class="font-data-mono text-body-sm text-machined-gold font-semibold">UG NX / Moldflow</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- High-Impact Stats Matrix -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter mt-space-2xl pt-space-xl bg-navy-surface/40 backdrop-blur-sm rounded p-space-md">
<div class="flex flex-col p-space-md">
<span class="font-metric-val text-metric-val text-white">15+</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-slate-400 uppercase mt-1">Years Industry Leadership</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-precision-teal mt-0.5">Proven Tamil Nadu Hub</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col p-space-md">
<span class="font-metric-val text-metric-val text-electric-cyan">D3</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-slate-400 uppercase mt-1">Design • Dev • Delivery</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300 mt-0.5">End-to-End Methodology</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col p-space-md">
<span class="font-metric-val text-metric-val text-machined-gold">±5μm</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-slate-400 uppercase mt-1">Makino VMC Precision</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300 mt-0.5">Optical &amp; CMM Verified</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col p-space-md">
<span class="font-metric-val text-metric-val text-status-success">100%</span>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-slate-400 uppercase mt-1">Zero Defect &amp; On-Time</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-300 mt-0.5">Mission-Critical SLAs</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- D3 METHODOLOGY ENGINE -->
<section class="w-full bg-surface py-space-3xl text-on-surface">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
<!-- Section Header -->
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-space-2xl gap-space-md">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider mb-space-xs">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">account_tree</span>
            Structured Engineering Framework
          </div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-slate-900">
            The D3 Execution Engine
          </h2>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-md">
          From native CAD concept to high-yield production, our unified 3-phase methodology eliminates mold rebuilds and accelerates industrialization.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- 3 Phase Workflow Cards -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter-desktop">
<!-- Step 1: Design -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-lg">
<span class="font-data-mono text-label-caps px-2.5 py-1 bg-surface-container-high rounded text-secondary font-bold">
                PHASE 01
              </span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-precision-teal text-[28px] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">architecture</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-slate-900 mb-space-sm">Design &amp; DFM</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-space-lg leading-relaxed">
              Comprehensive DFM analysis, 3D mold layout simulation, gate cooling optimization, and parting line feasibility check before steel cutting.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="space-y-space-xs font-data-mono text-body-sm pt-space-md bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700">
<span>Rheology Analysis</span>
<span class="text-status-success font-semibold">PASS</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700">
<span>Shrinkage Offset</span>
<span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Calibrated</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700">
<span>CAD Platforms</span>
<span class="text-secondary font-semibold">Creo / Solidworks</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Step 2: Development & Testing -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between group">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-lg">
<span class="font-data-mono text-label-caps px-2.5 py-1 bg-surface-container-high rounded text-secondary font-bold">
                PHASE 02
              </span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-machined-gold text-[28px] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">precision_manufacturing</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-slate-900 mb-space-sm">Development &amp; Testing</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-space-lg leading-relaxed">
              Makino VMC high-speed machining, precision EDM, tool assembly, and initial T0-T1 mold sampling runs under strict process validation.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="space-y-space-xs font-data-mono text-body-sm pt-space-md bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700">
<span>EDM Spark Gap</span>
<span class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">0.015 mm</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700">
<span>Tool Steel Standard</span>
<span class="text-machined-gold font-semibold">H13 / Stavax ESR</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700">
<span>Sample Validation</span>
<span class="text-status-success font-semibold">T1 First Article</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
