<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-slate-900 mb-space-sm">
          Precision Tooling &amp; Machining Snapshot
        </h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
          Advanced CNC machining centers, electrode milling, and optical grinding systems delivering aerospace &amp; medical-grade repeatability.
        </p>
</div>
<!-- 4 Pillars Bento Grid -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter">
<!-- Spec 1: High Speed CNC Milling -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-precision-teal mb-space-md">
