<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-space-xs">High-Speed CNC Milling</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Makino VMC high-rigidity spindles reaching 20,000 RPM for mirror cavity finishes and fine graphite electrode fabrication.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="font-data-mono text-label-caps text-slate-600 bg-surface-container-low p-2 rounded flex justify-between">
<span>Accuracy</span>
<span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">± 0.003 mm</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Spec 2: Micro EDM & Wire Cut -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-machined-gold mb-space-md">
