</div>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary">CAPABILITY // 02</span>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-slate-900 mt-1 mb-space-xs">CNC Wire EDM &amp; Spark</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-space-md">
              Sub-micron spark erosion for deep ribs, fine gate pins, hardened core slides, and intricate medical micro-shutoffs.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="font-data-mono text-label-caps text-slate-600 bg-surface-container-low p-2 rounded flex justify-between">
<span>Surface Finish</span>
<span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">Ra 0.2 μm</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Spec 3: Surface & Cylindrical Grinding -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-precision-teal mb-space-md">
